1
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,250
What are you looking at?

2
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,120
Nothing.

3
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,400
I just lost my husband.

4
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,520
I am a young widow.

5
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,960
I don't have time to play

6
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,360
romantic games with you.

7
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,900
Drop your little schemes.

8
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:19,120
Why don't you two stay inside a bit longer?

9
00:01:24,039 --> 00:01:24,840
Yes, yes, yes.

10
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,520
I will deal with it seriously.

11
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:26,920
Okay.

12
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:33,479
See, I told you my intel was reliable.

13
00:01:33,479 --> 00:01:35,120
I watched them go in with my own eyes.

14
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:37,280
If you saw them, why didn't you stop them?

15
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:39,410
I saw that little Taoist nun was there.

16
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:41,120
I was afraid Lord Huo would make things difficult for you later.

17
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:41,840
That's true.

18
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,240
How did they end up there?

19
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:00,880
After you, Madam.

20
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:04,720
Boss Ye.

21
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,480
What brings you here?

22
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,240
Boss Ye.

23
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:09,639
What kind of business do you need to handle?

24
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:12,360
The customer who just left,

25
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,890
what business was he doing?

26
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,880
I'm sorry, Boss Ye.

27
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,320
You know our rules.

28
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,120
I understand.

29
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,440
Where is my safe?

30
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,480
Number three.

31
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:23,280
Come this way.

32
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:25,280
What does number three mean, Young Master?

33
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,010
Don't speak.

34
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,880
You're just a servant. Stop talking.

35
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,610
Don't speak.

36
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,320
After you, Madam.

37
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,060
Please.

38
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,360
You,

39
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:33,840
stay here.

40
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:34,600
Yes, Young Master.

41
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,930
We have big things to do.

42
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:37,850
Come, Mr. Ye.

43
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:38,650
This way.

44
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:39,720
This way, please.

45
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:42,200
Madam.

46
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,120
The diamond necklace my mom gave me,

47
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,720
I put it in the safe.

48
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,740
Where is the necklace?

49
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,480
I remember now.

50
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:51,880
It doesn't seem to be in the safe.

51
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,340
Let's hurry up and go then.

52
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,640
I just remembered something.

53
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:56,720
We need to go now.

54
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:57,850
We'll be back later.

55
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:58,720
It's okay.

56
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,040
Let's go.

57
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:02,480
Go.

58
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:11,460
Bai Xianming wants to deposit money into this bank.

59
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:14,120
What do these letters mean?

60
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,400
This is William Ray.

61
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:18,840
It's an English name.

62
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:22,440
Translated, this Ray can be the Chinese surname Lei.

63
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,920
Then it must be Lei Lie.

64
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:25,920
That means,

65
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,200
after Bai Xianming receives

66
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,320
the remittance from the hospital every month,

67
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,780
he transfers it to Lei Lie.

68
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:32,370
We have to find a way to locate this person.

69
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,000
Ningning,

70
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,320
you'll have to bear with it for a bit.

71
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:37,320
That bastard is named William Ray.

72
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,880
He said he is in England,

73
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,800
has a big house,

74
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,480
fifty acres wide.

75
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:48,560
And he also opened a red wine...

76
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,520
You know.

77
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,240
Red wine.

78
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,320
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

79
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:55,600
So he hopes I can fund his return to England.

80
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,600
Put it this way.

81
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:57,280
Miss.

82
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,730
Get to the point.

83
00:03:58,920 --> 00:03:59,960
The point is,

84
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,920
I gave him some money,

85
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,520
and then, boom,

86
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:06,400
he disappeared.

87
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:10,480
This is considered fraud.

88
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,160
Exactly.

89
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:12,680
You can.

90
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,440
I promise you.

91
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,240
I promise you.

92
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,720
I, Zhou Wei, promise you.

93
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:18,120
I will definitely help you find the scammer.

94
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,120
Mr. Ye,

95
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,279
our William Firm

96
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:24,280
is the most famous firm in the British Empire.

97
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,080
May I ask, Mr. Ye,

98
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,960
what business you plan to cooperate with us on?

99
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,400
Could you give me a copy

100
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,120
of the detailed information about William Firm

101
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:32,920
to look at?

102
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,440
Please wait a moment.

103
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,720
I'll go get it now.

104
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,520
This William Lei is not Lei Lie,

105
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,760
but Lei Lie's son who is studying in the UK,

106
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:11,600
Lei Zijun.

107
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,120
In this William Firm,

108
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,020
Lei Zijun also has shares.

109
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,200
All the banned drugs are smuggled by William Firm

110
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:19,840
through a British company

111
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:21,440
called Black Mass.

112
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,720
With this evidence,

113
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,520
Lei Lie is doomed.

114
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,880
Superintendent Li,

115
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,940
can I apply for an arrest warrant now?

116
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:30,760
The evidence is conclusive.

117
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:31,760
Let's move.

118
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,600
Search the place.

119
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,320
Sir, we didn't find him.

120
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,880
Bai Xianming escaped.

121
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:02,960
To the concession.

122
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,480
Li Chengrui.

123
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,520
Why are you here?

124
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,040
Where is he?

125
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,320
He escaped.

126
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,200
After him!

127
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,400
After him!

128
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,320
After him!

129
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,520
I told you before,

130
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,560
I'm always ready for your visit.

131
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,400
All right.

132
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:24,520
Then come with us.

133
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:26,320
Detective Jiang.

134
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:28,000
You are using Hanyang rifles.

135
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,040
My brothers are using

136
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,880
imported German Mausers.

137
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:32,320
If the guns go off,

138
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,400
who do you think has the advantage?

139
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,320
Bullets

140
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:36,680
are blind.

141
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,480
No matter what,

142
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,040
I must take you away today.

143
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,409
That depends on whether

144
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,120
you have what it takes.

145
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,640
All of you, step outside.

146
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,080
You guys step outside too.

147
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,680
If Detective Jiang can beat me today,

148
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,320
I'll go with her.

149
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:49,400
No one is to stop us.

150
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,400
You step outside too.

151
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:53,560
No.

152
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:54,920
Even though I don't have a gun,

153
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,560
I can stay as a witness.

154
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:58,880
Excuse me.

155
00:06:58,880 --> 00:06:59,720
Hurry up.

156
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,320
Hurry up.

157
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,400
If he gets away,

158
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,920
I won't spare you, you know?

159
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,450
Hurry up.

160
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,200
Hurry.

161
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,120
Iron Sand Palm.

162
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,520
You killed Zheng Kun.

163
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,280
Cut the crap.

164
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:15,880
Tell me,

165
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,320
why didn't you set up a checkpoint for me?

166
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:18,520
I did.

167
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,920
You might not understand how checkpoints work.

168
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,440
Look at all these intersections.

169
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,880
We don't have enough police force.

170
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:25,720
You'd better stay far away later.

171
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,800
If there's any danger,

172
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,130
I won't be able to explain it to Master Huo.

173
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,640
Bai Xianming!

174
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,919
Chase him!

175
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,480
Stop! Stop!

176
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:42,840
Who told you to shoot?

177
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:43,840
My lady,

178
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,720
didn't you say

179
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,760
not to let him step into the concession?

180
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:46,240
You...

181
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:51,080
Hos...

182
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:53,520
pital.

183
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,530
What did you say?

184
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:58,040
Take him to the hospital, hurry!

185
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,640
Doctor, how is his condition?

186
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,120
He is out of danger,

187
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:10,050
but the patient is still very weak.

188
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:11,720
Okay.

189
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,200
Senior Sister.

190
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:20,640
Professor Bai is dead.

191
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:22,720
How did he die?

192
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,240
Chief Lei,

193
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,200
for you to end up here,

194
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,320
this matter

195
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:28,760
is no small one.

196
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:31,280
If I don't meet a good end today,

197
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:34,780
I'm afraid neither of us will end up well.

198
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,000
Say what you should say,

199
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,850
but for what you shouldn't,

200
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:43,480
you must think twice.

201
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:50,800
Detective Jiang,

202
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:51,800
why are you here?

203
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,240
Bai Xianming is dead.

204
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:55,200
I just wanted to injure him.

205
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,800
I didn't expect to kill him.

206
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,400
I have to come keep an eye on Lei Lie.

207
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,480
If he dies,

208
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,600
this case will be even harder to solve.

209
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,840
Our prison,

210
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,360
even if not impregnable,

211
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:07,320
wouldn't just let outsiders in.

212
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,450
Superintendent Li,

213
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:10,120
how about I interrogate him?

214
00:10:12,040 --> 00:10:12,520
Okay.

215
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,320
Lei Lie.

216
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,520
The evidence is conclusive now.

217
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:23,000
You'd better confess.

218
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:23,920
Evidence?

219
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:25,840
What evidence?

220
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:28,540
If you had evidence, why would you ask me?

221
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,800
Lei Lie.

222
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,200
Don't be too arrogant.

223
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:31,880
All right.

224
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,200
Stop wasting time.

225
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:34,560
You're too green.

226
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,600
You can't do anything to me.

227
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,880
Since Chief Lei is so confident,

228
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,730
why are you still sitting here?

229
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,920
Remember this.

230
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:44,130
My dad and Jinwen won't die in vain.

231
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,120
No.

232
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:47,280
Why do you keep picking on me?

233
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:49,520
Their deaths have nothing to do with me.

234
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,520
If you don't confess clearly today,

235
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:53,250
you won't walk out of this door.

236
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:57,370
Do you dare to make a bet with me?

237
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:58,300
Bet on what?

238
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,520
Of course, bet that I

239
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,640
will walk out of here safely.
